    "No direct absolute oral bioavailability (oral vs IV) measurement for the query.",
    "No query-matched AUC/Cmax with IV comparator; erlotinib records are for a close analog, not the query.",
    "No formulation, dose, or species match for the query.",
    "Batefenterol and DA-8010 L3 records are not applicable to the 4-anilinoquinazoline scaffold."
  ],
  "decision_summary": "Prediction remains high: L3 oral exposure records for the closest structural analog erlotinib show substantial oral Cmax, supporting absorption of the 4-anilinoquinazoline scaffold, while all direct low-F references are structurally unrelated and not transferable. No affirmative threshold-relevant evidence supports F<20% for the query."
}

